{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NO SAVING. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NO HOPE. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NO ESCAPE.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To die, or to face my fears... that is my choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mommy don't hurt me mommy don't hurt me mommy don't hurt me is a 'sit-n-survive' horror game, where you must live through 3 long nights, facing the monsters of unstable child's mind. The only thing you can do is defend yourself, using your knowledge and resource management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is permanent. If you lost you have to start all over again, until you finally overcome the horrors that lie within the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck! You'll definitely need it...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The game was made in RenPy engine.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4159120?t=1763045190","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159120/4aefe7d6ad064a7f9fe0a4590ede2c3428355de4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763045190","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159120/b73990f0feee0cb7c4c5e2bce42fcab4851401bd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763045190","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159120/b73990f0feee0cb7c4c5e2bce42fcab4851401bd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763045190","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4170070,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NO SAVING. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NO HOPE. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NO ESCAPE.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\